{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultists have attacked your village and destroyed your home. Set out on a quest for vengeance and use your mastery of dice, probabilities, and magic to settle the score or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome the odds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/extras/54546df806fc85eef63c8ae4b7d613b2.avif?t=1770828955\" width=1146 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Dice - Roll the dice you've collected in sequential order to complete quests and obtain rewards. Fail and receive nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes - Choose between Story Mode and Endless Mode. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and Try Again - Live, die, and repeat. No two runs are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship - Collect a variety of companions to aid you in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice - Boost your power with a variety of dice and special dice effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent Upgrades - No luck this time? Purchase persistent upgrades to boost your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up - Earn experience to unlock attributes and acquire items and equipment to build your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses - Overcome a range of powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements - 19 Steam achievements to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad Support - Full Xbox controller support and Steam Deck support (upcoming).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093860?t=1770828955","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/bcc2ac12baa266d5c7d39910ac4373533d4d0417/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770828955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/00324877db00846f980d8fabd5b332d1d78befa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770828955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/00324877db00846f980d8fabd5b332d1d78befa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770828955","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4241210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultists have attacked your village and destroyed your home. Set out on a quest for vengeance and use your mastery of dice, probabilities, and magic to settle the score or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome the odds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/extras/54546df806fc85eef63c8ae4b7d613b2.avif?t=1770828955\" width=1146 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Dice - Roll the dice you've collected in sequential order to complete quests and obtain rewards. Fail and receive nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes - Choose between Story Mode and Endless Mode. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and Try Again - Live, die, and repeat. No two runs are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship - Collect a variety of companions to aid you in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice - Boost your power with a variety of dice and special dice effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent Upgrades - No luck this time? Purchase persistent upgrades to boost your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up - Earn experience to unlock attributes and acquire items and equipment to build your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses - Overcome a range of powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements - 19 Steam achievements to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad Support - Full Xbox controller support and Steam Deck support (upcoming).</p>","developers":["Pixel Chicken Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/f5df1d955aa00cd7ff80935ea3b8f8bf7fdf7333/header.jpg?t=1770828955","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093860/2126095103/4893b58b626d6ef8033410e6274bdf608489d59f/1762870587/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762889538","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093860/2126095103/4893b58b626d6ef8033410e6274bdf608489d59f/1762870587/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762889538","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093860/2126095103/4893b58b626d6ef8033410e6274bdf608489d59f/1762870587/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762889538","id":257229608,"name":"Dice Odyssey Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229608/51136e31a3dc43a5946cd3bca89c120400ad5d91/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762889538"}],"name":"Dice Odyssey","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>S